# Jordan's job search

Solaris Energy offered me the job after a second interview, at 68,000, and I accepted. I withdrew my other applications, and told Sarah at GreenTalent.

The search is over, so my job search habits and my follow-ups with the agents now have an end date: a schedule with an end date stops adding tasks after that day. My monthly catch-ups with Mark and Hannah carry on. They helped me find this job, and they are worth keeping in touch with.

The final numbers are 4 applications, 3 interviews and 1 offer. The withdrawn applications no longer count as responses, so the response rate shows 50%.

