    Worries:
    * Rejections knock my confidence and I stop applying
        Cause: Years out of the job market, and a rejection already
        Consequence: Fewer applications, and a longer search
        RiskType: Emotional
        Likelihood: 6
        Severity: 7
        Controls:
        * Stick to the routine, whatever the answers|Prevent|60|0
            Tasks:
            * Judge the search by the Friday numbers, not by each rejection as it comes
